# The sun's screen ray over the grass (../README.md), the clips of the acceptance: the user judges
# «без луча | с лучом» by eye. Two runs record the same clips, without it (OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_CONTACT=0) and the
# game's; ../../2026-11-15-night-interiors/tools/lamp_contact_clips.py puts them side by side:
#   lamp_contact_clips.py <without> <with> <out> --prefix grass-contact-
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen \
#     OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<the working content> [OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_CONTACT=0] scripts/bench.sh <this file> <out>
# The wind is the game's: the shadows move with the blades.
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
blink off
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
goto pos 41001 3440 -507
clear 3000
streaming wait
grass wait
watch player
# 1. Noon: a held camera at the hero's feet while he turns on the spot, then he walks before the game's camera
set time 12 0
wait 4000
cam cut
cam look 10
cam world 110 35 0
wait 3000
cam hold
rec noon-feet-turn
wait 1000
hold turnl 6000
wait 7000
stop
cam game
wait 3000
rec noon-walk
wait 1000
walkmode walk
hold forward 6000
wait 6500
stop
# 2. The morning, a lower sun: a low held camera along the grass, the wind moves it
set time 9 0
wait 4000
cam cut
cam look 20
cam world 150 25 60
wait 3000
cam hold
rec morning-low-wind
wait 1000
wait 7000
stop
cam game
wait 3000
rec morning-walk
wait 1000
walkmode walk
hold turnl 1500
wait 2000
hold forward 6000
wait 6500
stop
# 3. The late afternoon: long shadows, the hero walks before the game's camera
set time 17 30
wait 4000
cam game
wait 3000
rec late-walk
wait 1000
walkmode walk
hold turnl 1500
wait 2000
hold forward 6000
wait 6500
stop
